{"meta":{"id":"tt40385667","type":"series","name":"La Isla Del Tesoro","imdb_id":"tt40385667","description":"Cuando Jim se hace con un legendario mapa del tesoro, las acciones inteligentes y decididas de su madre, Bess, hacen que él acabe en posesión de una valiosa información que pone en peligro la vida de ambos. A bordo del «Hispaniola», Jim y Bess se ven atrapados entre el encantador y aterrador pirata Long John Silver y el elegante y traicionero agente británico Aaron Graham.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt40385667.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/grC6bTUTeVvjZ2orztjItUxM4yy.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kgKGETBJYWkZv3q70B20a5f5xoj.png","genres":["Action & Adventure"],"releaseInfo":"2026-","released":"2026-10-11T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Returning Series","imdbRating":"4.5","country":"United States of America, United Kingdom","cast":["David Oyelowo","Tom Sweet","תומר קאפון","Craige Els","Neil Pendleton","George Frost","Mayen Mehta","Tadhg Murphy","Tristan Sturrock","Jack Huston","Adam James","Hayley Atwell"],"writer":["Robert Murphy","Robert Louis Stevenson"],"trailers":[{"source":"UsFVIvngwRA","type":"Trailer","name":"Official UK & Ireland Trailer","ytId":"UsFVIvngwRA","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"UsFVIvngwRA","title":"Official UK & Ireland Trailer"}],"links":[{"name":"4.5","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt40385667"},{"name":"Action & Adventure","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Action+%26+Adventure"},{"name":"David Oyelowo","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=David%20Oyelowo"},{"name":"Tom Sweet","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Tom%20Sweet"},{"name":"תומר קאפון","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=%D7%AA%D7%95%D7%9E%D7%A8%20%D7%A7%D7%90%D7%A4%D7%95%D7%9F"},{"name":"Craige Els","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///se