6_and_h350_face/5YQzdACbDvDwcfITmcwxMUEPJLK.jpg","tmdbId":1256162},{"name":"Tristan Sturrock","character":"Captain Smollett","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/kVKZJMocabPzk7ZdlPWUua5USbg.jpg","tmdbId":24267},{"name":"Jack Huston","character":"Aaron Graham","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/qWGoZaUbeuaOLbDvyP5txYr9Hct.jpg","tmdbId":54738},{"name":"Adam James","character":"Squire Livesey","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/5aVa1LgnOzkzsIYdcb1QUTxV5g3.jpg","tmdbId":47933},{"name":"Hayley Atwell","character":"Bess Hawkins","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/x57wXHexIjD2ywly9cRA4rov7cu.jpg","tmdbId":39459}],"writers":[{"name":"Robert Murphy","character":"Robert Murphy","photo":null,"tmdbId":1288924},{"name":"Robert Louis Stevenson","character":"Robert Louis Stevenson","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/4gHYG4Gn1uxmG0k1gilfp8cwdBX.jpg","tmdbId":29533}],"certification":"TV-PG","seasonPosters":["https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rnTcsrrDckwC2QmEQ1M7YfJDMN7.jpg"]},"behaviorHints":{"hasScheduledVideos":true},"videos":[{"id":"tt40385667:1:1","season":1,"episode":1,"title":"The Admiral Benbow","overview":"Jim Hawkins and his mother Bess are pulled into a dangerous world when a sailor washes ashore with a pirate’s treasure map. Deciding to seek the treasure for themselves they set sail on the Hispaniola, unaware of the danger on board.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/72JK3w67KpJkSeEFsHUQzz9yY3x.jpg","released":"2026-10-11T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"45 min"},{"id":"tt40385667:1:2","season":1,"episode":2,"title":"Great Britain","overview":"Onboard the Hispaniola, Bess targets Graham for protection as Long John lays the groundwork for mutiny with the crew. When violence erupts, Jim makes a calculated move that shifts the balance, tipping the scales in Long John's favor.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rAUIKPwoX7PVTNpzpKrXPiWJFWn.jpg","released":"2026-10-18T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"44 min"},{"id":"tt40385667:1:3","season":1,"episode":3,"title":"The Wide Eternal Sea","overview":"Alliances fracture as the voyage wears on; Bess and Graham play a cat-and-mouse game, while Long John targets Jim; when Graham makes his move, the truth surfaces; the consequences are deadly and Jim is forced to take control of his fate.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/24cxbvEbn8xKSUNNW1Zc1rNEQ9x.jpg","released":"2026-10-25T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"45 min"},{"id":"tt40385667:1:4","season":1,"episode":4,"title":"San Domingue","overview":"Jim saves Long John's life, knowing he still needs him; Graham draws Jim into the world of San Domingue, witnessing power, politics and revolution up close; chaos erupts and Long John gains control of the ship - but Jim has an ace up his sleeve.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mEPJ9aUD8qFOpiwhNpbvWOoReJa.jpg","released":"2026-11-01T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"46 min"},{"id":"tt40385667:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"Skeleton Island","overview":"On Skeleton Island, Jim leads the search for the treasure as tension and paranoia rise when the island's dark history emerges; jockeying for control they finally reach the fortune - but an unexpected force intervenes before anyone can claim it.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dc6UgNmdva5ymmqA6vvRlx0DVLT.jpg","released":"2026-11-08T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"tt40385667:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"A Princesa De Aveiro","overview":"Captive on Skeleton Island, Jim turns the tables in an attempt to catch up to Long John before he can leave with the treasure; back at sea, alliances fracture and reunite, binding the survivors together in a dangerous new partnership.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1VM9sH9hMeMdWEtrQQl9ljzeRU4.jpg","released":"2026-11-15T12:00:00.000Z"}]}}